OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStarting
OL,6,Fcloudy with patchy light rain, mainly
OL,7,Faffecting southern areas. Overnight
OL,8,Fturning mostly dry with broken cloud.
OL,9,FClearer spells will gradually spread
OL,10,Fsouthwards. Feeling colder than recent
OL,11,Fnights. Minimum Temperature 2C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FLargely dry with bright or
OL,14,Fsunny spells and patchy cloud,
OL,15,Falthough isolated light showers are
OL,16,Fexpected, especially later near
OL,17,Fcoasts. Feeling cold with temperatures
OL,18,Fslightly below average. Maximum
OL,19,FTemperature 8C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
