OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fsunshine and scattered coastal
OL,7,Fshowers. Tuesday cloudy conditions
OL,8,Fwith rain may arrive, risk of hill
OL,9,Fsleet or snow. Wednesday wintry
OL,10,Fshowers, probably heavy. Generally
OL,11,Fcold with some overnight frosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
